                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "daf9176e-3e9c-42cd-93c7-6ae3a0a4938f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fdf19f1-db97-3da5-b2f7-9cfe53074bb8",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bcbd7ed-ed94-3464-a526-0cffe00bba62",
                        "target_lang_word": "ostracism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ostracism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                        "entry_id": "d5d0f48e-ee80-3ba5-b437-915fcff3a7ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In ancient Athens (and some other cities), the temporary banishment by popular vote of a citizen considered dangerous to the state."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7606a8c4-5979-447c-9999-4f329dae263d",
                                                "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                                "text": "For this manner of banishment for a time, called ostracismos, was no punishment for any fault committed, but a mitigation and taking away of the envy of the people, which delighted to pluck down their stomacks that too much seemed to exceed in greatness: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f6f1198-e61b-4dda-a7f6-b1d70f2a6ebf",
                                                "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                                "text": "Take the ſweete herbe called pleaſant content; with that make a perfume about your bed chamber and where you dyne: the ſavour of this is as ſure a repulſe to exile melancholie, as the oſtracisme was to the noble of Athens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac555844-51ce-4d22-9e6e-0c2c6b30c0d6",
                                                "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                                "text": "Witnesse the Ostracisme amongst the Athenians, and the Petalisme among the Siracusans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7629623b-d171-35b2-86fd-cd440b557f15",
                                        "entry_id": "d5d0f48e-ee80-3ba5-b437-915fcff3a7ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Banishment by some general consent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ea1f59d-7e12-492b-837a-908c32f10896",
                                                "sense_id": "7629623b-d171-35b2-86fd-cd440b557f15",
                                                "text": "If I have deserved the land should spue me out, I will feed my selfe with the idle and windy conceite of an Ostracisme, and my unregarded poore selfe shall be all the richesse and commpany I crave to transport and if a Princes word […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c5c1dae-b552-33a4-ab88-828436942eb1",
                                        "entry_id": "d5d0f48e-ee80-3ba5-b437-915fcff3a7ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Temporary exclusion from a community or society."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "26a65f5e-dcdc-4868-8a2b-18a0c5ffe9c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fdf19f1-db97-3da5-b2f7-9cfe53074bb8",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bcbd7ed-ed94-3464-a526-0cffe00bba62",
                        "target_lang_word": "ostracisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ostracisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9003f6a-fd90-3c75-9f03-27a1a76ea435",
                                        "entry_id": "f340af2c-ea83-3c71-b53e-ced9f63d0e26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vote par lequel certaines cités grecques bannissaient pour dix ans les citoyens qui avaient encouru la défaveur publique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "364c9f17-dc39-48ad-9abb-ca4cdd5caa4a",
                                                "sense_id": "d9003f6a-fd90-3c75-9f03-27a1a76ea435",
                                                "text": "Mais par la suite l’ostracisme devait constituer une arme redoutable entre les mains du démos, et les nombreux ostraka qui sont parvenus jusqu’à nous montrent qu’aucun homme politique athénien n’échappa à la méfiance populaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2524a86-90d6-3d0a-b212-a52d8d8ec4d9",
                                        "entry_id": "f340af2c-ea83-3c71-b53e-ced9f63d0e26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Parti pris d’exclusion à l’égard d’une personne ou d’un groupement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc6b5179-fbdb-49fc-8898-08ea01bc5386",
                                                "sense_id": "c2524a86-90d6-3d0a-b212-a52d8d8ec4d9",
                                                "text": "Victime d’un ostracisme qui lui rendait l’existence insupportable, la petite fille, sur le chemin du retour, ne parvenait pas à se décider si elle se jetterait dans la grande « boutasse » des Thiollière ou si elle se pendrait au hêtre qui marquait une limite du domaine paternel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b812a86-aed6-4811-8e01-70e165f08990",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fdf19f1-db97-3da5-b2f7-9cfe53074bb8",
                        "source_sense_id": "4bcbd7ed-ed94-3464-a526-0cffe00bba62",
